ntern\n+ Managed volunteer outreach and logistics\n* Created advertisements and brochures using Adobe InDesign and Photoshop\n\nDefense Institute of Security Cooperation Studies May-July 2013\nWright-Patterson Air Force Base, Ohio\nAfrican Seminar Intern\n* Prepared over 50 military officers for tours of duty across Africa by creating\nsensitive briefings on diplomatic regions, in-depth analyses and threat\nassessments, using open source resources\n\u2018+ Audited seminars on AFRICOM, foreign military sales, and security",
